From 407eb3f79abd1feb80aa369cd2412b4f536d90aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:33:39 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 08/29] inkling2: take the drafter's taps from its config, so
 Mini's four taps by visit load

Small reads eight taps (seven layer inputs and the head's input), Mini four (the inputs of visits 5, 23 and 41
and the head's input). The tap count now comes from mtp_config's target_layer_ids: the forward's tap rows, the
slots' stash, the fuse weights and the mix calls use it, and Small's eight give the same layout and launches as
before. The engine no longer skips Mini's drafter.
---
